00:06:28.735 --> 00:06:32.767
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:33.367 --> 00:06:40.375
<v Slow>「技能五輪国際大会」は、どこで開かれましたか。

00:06:41.175 --> 00:06:43.264
