00:06:43.863 --> 00:06:49.120
<v Slow>日本は、メダルを何個取りましたか。

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.752
<v Host>Ten medals, including two golds.

00:06:53.351 --> 00:06:59.447
<v Slow>大会には、どんな人たちが参加しましたか。

00:07:00.247 --> 00:07:05.839
<v Host>Young people aged twenty-two or under, from about seventy countries and regions.

00:07:06.439 --> 00:07:11.815
<v Slow>次の大会は、どこで開かれますか。

00:07:12.615 --> 00:07:16.863
<v Host>In Aichi Prefecture, Japan, two years from now.

00:07:17.463 --> 00:07:27.303
<v Host>That's all for today. In two years, the world's best young workers will gather in Japan — something to look forward to. See you next time.

00:07:27.903 --> 00:07:30.303
